  tf.linalg.diag_part(input, k = (1, 3), padding_value = 9)
    ==> [[[4, 9, 9],  # Output shape: (2, 3, 3)
          [3, 8, 9],
          [2, 7, 6]],
         [[2, 9, 9],
          [3, 4, 9],
          [4, 3, 8]]]

  ```

